        "seo_toggle_label": "More about our custom transfers",
        "seo_content": "<p>Looking for the best place to order custom DTF transfers that are vibrant, durable, and delivered fast? You have found it. At Fineyst Transfers, we are your go-to source for press-ready transfers with no order minimums, expert support, and no setup fees.</p><p><strong>HERE'S WHAT YOU SHOULD KNOW RIGHT AWAY:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>TURNAROUND TIME:</strong> Most orders are printed and shipped within 24 hours, with same-day options available.</li><li><strong>TRANSFER TYPES WE PRINT:</strong> Choose from <a href=\"/products/dtf-transfers\">DTF by size</a>, <a href=\"/products/uv-dtf-gang-sheet-builder\">gang sheets</a>, <a href=\"/products/uv-dtf-perma-stickers\">UV DTF</a>, <a href=\"/products/puff-transfers\" title=\"Puff Transfers\">puff</a>, <a href=\"/products/glitter-transfers\" title=\"Glitter Transfers\">glitter</a>, and <a href=\"/products/reflective-transfers\" title=\"REFLECTIVE TRANSFERS\">reflective transfers</a> - all press-ready.</li><li><strong>COMMON USES:</strong> Perfect for t-shirts, hoodies, hats, tote bags, team merch, uniforms, event apparel, and more.</li><li><strong>WHAT FABRICS WORK?</strong> Cotton, polyester, blends, canvas, denim, nylon, and more - light or dark, no special prep needed.</li><li><strong>DESIGN HELP & FILE PREP:</strong> Send a PNG, PDF, or AI file and we will handle the rest. Not print-ready? Our team will clean it up free.</li><li><strong>ARE DTF TRANSFERS EXPENSIVE? NOT HERE.</strong> You get wholesale pricing, volume discounts, free shipping, and no hidden fees.</li></ul><p><strong>Ready to Get Started?</strong></p><p>Upload your artwork today - it is fast, free to quote, and fully supported by real humans who care about print quality.</p>",
        "grid_heading": "\"Shop Custom Transfers by Type\"",
